# No client-side secrets are needed. Cloudflare credentials belong in Wrangler/CI.
# Provision account passwords interactively with npm run user:create.
# Worker secrets (wrangler secret put NAME; local dev: .dev.vars, never committed):
# STOCK_SEED_SECRET=   # 32+ random characters; seeds stock prices. Changing it changes future prices.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=  # optional; Claude engine for AI stock news
# OPENAI_API_KEY=     # optional; OpenAI engine (the admin console picks the engine; default OpenAI)
# Without the chosen engine's key, template news is used. Never commit a real key.
